136
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:41,160
or parts of their votes.

137
00:05:41,160 --> 00:05:44,440
So that's a case where the institution of democracy itself

138
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:47,720
will reverse what you try to do in order to fix it.

139
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:49,480
And what the second law of the theorem says

140
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:51,320
